{
    "title": "Rhythm Hop 3D: Ball Music Game",
    "description": "Rhythm Hop 3D is inviting you to join in! Are you a fan of music games that challenge your limits with thousands of songs? Look no further than Rhythm Hop 3D - the ultimate music game that blends song games and ball games! Classic gameplay mechanics combined with meticulously designed 3D game scenes bring you an extraordinary experience like a live concert. It's simple and fun: just drag your ball to jump left or right, and make sure to hop on the next music tile and avoid falling. Download this game now and show us how far you can jump!\r\n\r\n\u3010Easy Control with Finger\u3011\r\n1. Tiles will appear with music.\r\n2. Hold and drag the ball to jump left or right on the next tile.\r\n3. Hop on the center of the tiles for higher scores.\r\n4. Try not to miss any tiles to keep the game going.\r\n5. Stay vigilant and watch out for traps!\r\n6. Collect as many coins as you can to unlock new songs and characters.\r\nMost importantly, enjoy the addictive challenges and beats designed for each song.\r\n\r\n\u3010Standout Features of Game\u3011\r\n- One-touch control, relaxing and casual game\r\n- Various music styles, including but not limited to EDM, hip-hop, rock, R&B, country, and folk\r\n- Worldwide hot songs, e.g.., TikTok hit songs for your choice\r\n- Bright colors and stunning 3D visual effect\r\n- Perfect test of reflexes and coordination\r\n- Fabulous choice to kill time anytime, anywhere\r\nMore characters are being continuously updated...\r\n\r\nIf any producer or label has an issue with any of the music used in the game, please send an email to publish@humshan.com, and it will be deleted immediately if necessary (this includes the images used).",
    "descriptionHTML": "Rhythm Hop 3D is inviting you to join in! Are you a fan of music games that challenge your limits with thousands of songs? Look no further than Rhythm Hop 3D - the ultimate music game that blends song games and ball games! Classic gameplay mechanics combined with meticulously designed 3D game scenes bring you an extraordinary experience like a live concert. It&#39;s simple and fun: just drag your ball to jump left or right, and make sure to hop on the next music tile and avoid falling. Download this game now and show us how far you can jump!<br><br>\u3010Easy Control with Finger\u3011<br>1. Tiles will appear with music.<br>2. Hold and drag the ball to jump left or right on the next tile.<br>3. Hop on the center of the tiles for higher scores.<br>4. Try not to miss any tiles to keep the game going.<br>5. Stay vigilant and watch out for traps!<br>6. Collect as many coins as you can to unlock new songs and characters.<br>Most importantly, enjoy the addictive challenges and beats designed for each song.<br><br>\u3010Standout Features of Game\u3011<br>- One-touch control, relaxing and casual game<br>- Various music styles, including but not limited to EDM, hip-hop, rock, R&amp;B, country, and folk<br>- Worldwide hot songs, e.g.., TikTok hit songs for your choice<br>- Bright colors and stunning 3D visual effect<br>- Perfect test of reflexes and coordination<br>- Fabulous choice to kill time anytime, anywhere<br>More characters are being continuously updated...<br><br>If any producer or label has an issue with any of the music used in the game, please send an email to publish@humshan.com, and it will be deleted immediately if necessary (this includes the images used).",
